    "en": {
      "name": "Number 101: Silent Honor ARK - Soul Asylum",
      "effect": "2 Level 4 monsters\nYou can detach 1 material from this card, then activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25cf Choose 1 Level 4 monster in your GY, except the detached material, and add 1 Level 4 monster with the same Type and Attribute, but a different name, from your Deck to your hand.\n\u25cf Target 1 monster your opponent controls; attach it to this card.\nYou can only use this effect of \"Number 101: Silent Honor ARK - Soul Asylum\" once per turn. If this card would be destroyed, you can detach 1 material from this card instead.",
      "official": false
    },
